    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Scheduled Workflows\n\n**CHARACTERISTICS:**\n* Run at predetermined times/intervals\n* Independent of external events\n* Predictable execution pattern\n\n**WHEN TO USE:**\n* Daily reports and reconciliation\n* Periodic data backups\n* Regular health checks\n* End-of-day processing\n\n**SCHEDULE TRIGGER OPTIONS:**\n* Seconds, Minutes, Hours intervals\n* Days, Weeks, Months intervals\n* Custom Cron expressions\n* Timezone-aware execution\n\n**REFERENCE:**\nhttps://docs.n8n.io/integrations/builtin/core-nodes/n8n-nodes-base.scheduletrigger/",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "c1222974-175c-4677-a6a1-8937e614cebe",
      "name": "Scheduled Pattern",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -32,
        -176
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Event-Driven Workflows\n\n**CHARACTERISTICS:**\n* Triggered by external events\n* Immediate response to actions\n* Unpredictable timing\n\n**WHEN TO USE:**\n* Transaction processing\n* Real-time alerts\n* API integrations\n* User-initiated actions\n\n**TRIGGER OPTIONS:**\n* Webhook: HTTP endpoints\n* App Triggers: Slack, Sheets, etc.\n* File system watchers\n* Database changes\n\n**BENEFITS:**\n* Instant processing\n* Resource-efficient\n* Scalable to demand",
        "height": 536,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "d64459d9-244c-4fc3-8558-92a7dc7f216a",
      "name": "Event-Driven Pattern",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -32,
        368
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Choosing the Right Pattern\n\n**USE SCHEDULED FOR:**\n* Batch processing\n* Reports requiring complete datasets\n* Non-urgent operations\n* Predictable workloads\n\n**USE EVENT-DRIVEN FOR:**\n* Real-time requirements\n* User interactions\n* External system integrations\n* Immediate notifications\n\n**HYBRID APPROACH:**\nCombine both patterns:\n* Events trigger immediate actions\n* Schedule handles aggregation\n* Example: Process transactions immediately, generate summary reports daily",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "b128f093-1680-4bba-bff4-1be5745e5fa9",
      "name": "Pattern Comparison",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        368,
        144
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Exercise\n\n**TASK 1: Scheduled Workflow**\nModify schedule to run every weekday at 5 PM\n\n**TASK 2: Event-Driven Workflow**\n1. Change the path to `retrieve-data`\n2. Test webhook with GET request\n\n\n**SUCCESS CRITERIA:**\n✓ Scheduled workflow activates correctly\n✓ Webhook accepts GET requests\n✓ Both patterns execute their logic",
